OL,5,G1255 Ride Lonesome
OL,6,     F(1959) Western. Randolph Scott
OL,7,     Fplays a bounty hunter who has
OL,8,     Funfinished business with the
OL,9,     Fbrother of his latest target. But
OL,10,     Fhis quest for revenge looks like
OL,11,     Fit could be undermined.
OL,12,G1425 Gun Fury
OL,13,     F(1953) Western. Rock Hudson stars
OL,14,     Fas a California-bound settler who
OL,15,     Fmust ride 1500 miles to the
OL,16,     FMexican border to rescue his
OL,17,     Ffiancee (Donna Reed) after she's
OL,18,     Fabducted by an outlaw.
